  "actor_notes": "Joss Fen\nLOOKS: Broad-faced adult in a faded green hood, clean boots, and fingerless gloves. Carries a folded tournament broadside.\nCORE: A cautious crowd thief who earns by making other people's mistakes look accidental.\nNATURE: Quiet, practical, and happiest when somebody else draws the eye.\nWOUND: A former partner once ran with the whole purse and left Joss for the watch; every escape route is now chosen in advance.\nWANTS: Get Pell clear and leave without being marked.\nPRESSURE: Abandons the job and walks rather than runs until directly seized.\nKEY: \"Mind your own belt.\"",
